<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Chemical sets terms on straight bonds.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Chemical sets terms on straight bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Sumitomo Chemical Co</p>
<p>Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Sumitomo Capital Securities</p>
<p>FISCAL AGENT - Sumitomo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE   straight	ISSUE NO   9	  AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE  par	MATURITY 18.Jun.02</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 18.Jun.97  INT PAY 18.Jun</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 28.May.97</p>
<p> LAST JCR  AA-	  LAST JBRI  AA-	LAST NIS</p>
<p>NOTE -- The coupon will be 1.70 percent from June 19, 1997, to June 18, 1998, 2.00 percent from June 19, 1998, to June 18, 1999, 2.30 percent from June 19, 1999, to June 18, 2000, 2.6 percent from June 19, 2000, to June 18, 2001, and 2.90 percent from June 19, 2001, to June 18, 2002.</p>
